<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h3 data-lake-id="tjohH" id="tjohH"><span data-lake-id="udf625ea7" id="udf625ea7">CPU 侧 DCache 接口</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u2e9df00f" id="u2e9df00f"><span data-lake-id="u91d41f3f" id="u91d41f3f">DCache 视角对外的CPU 只接这些口：两条 LoadPipe、一路 StoreBuffer、一路 AtomicsUnit、一路 CMO，以及 wfi。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7f253b4c" id="u7f253b4c"><span data-lake-id="u866590cf" id="u866590cf">MMIO 和非缓存访问走 Uncache，不进这里。香山用来通知 load queue“某行已被换出或失效”的 </span><code data-lake-id="uc3e7e5a9" id="uc3e7e5a9"><span data-lake-id="u1f6c9cda" id="u1f6c9cda">release</span></code><span data-lake-id="u4f3bdbe1" id="u4f3bdbe1"> 还没有接收者和字段，这页不留空行。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8beb2af8" id="u8beb2af8"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u15e3978f" id="u15e3978f"><span data-lake-id="u0457a490" id="u0457a490">其中load字段为loadpipe服务，store，atomics为MainPipe服务。CMOreq和CMOresp为MissQueue服务。wfi用于休眠。</span></p><table data-lake-id="NH0BG" id="NH0BG" class="lake-table" style="width: 572px"><colgroup><col width="100"><col width="97"><col width="187.5"><col width="187.5"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u6af98d1f" id="u6af98d1f"><td data-lake-id="uba8d9616" id="uba8d9616"><p data-lake-id="u6f0bb404" id="u6f0bb404"><span data-lake-id="u353ca01c" id="u353ca01c">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u82c851ec" id="u82c851ec"><p data-lake-id="u98adba42" id="u98adba42"><span data-lake-id="u9e817295" id="u9e817295">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6d47ed16" id="u6d47ed16"><p data-lake-id="u7b4dfe9a" id="u7b4dfe9a"><span data-lake-id="u68ed63cd" id="u68ed63cd">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue3503eba" id="ue3503eba"><p data-lake-id="ubdc81127" id="ubdc81127"><span data-lake-id="u936a2646" id="u936a2646">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub287fd77" id="ub287fd77"><td data-lake-id="ua78168f9" id="ua78168f9"><p data-lake-id="u329afd64" id="u329afd64"><span data-lake-id="uffe519a5" id="uffe519a5">load</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf82e4cc1" id="uf82e4cc1"><p data-lake-id="ua1f8cd0e" id="ua1f8cd0e"><span data-lake-id="u55c864b5" id="u55c864b5">in/out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1a513953" id="u1a513953"><p data-lake-id="u5fd1eb86" id="u5fd1eb86"><span data-lake-id="ud6beec3b" id="ud6beec3b">两条 </span><code data-lake-id="ua00d6027" id="ua00d6027"><span data-lake-id="u2821f21e" id="u2821f21e">DCacheLoadIO</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0dcb8a3f" id="u0dcb8a3f"><p data-lake-id="u8ba17561" id="u8ba17561"><span data-lake-id="u962458ed" id="u962458ed">普通 load、replay 后的 load、软件预取。预取不另开接口</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ud5d3c17d" id="ud5d3c17d"><td data-lake-id="u9ec45be8" id="u9ec45be8"><p data-lake-id="u51527d25" id="u51527d25"><span data-lake-id="uc5ef5592" id="uc5ef5592">store</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u824bee7f" id="u824bee7f"><p data-lake-id="u04bbcc38" id="u04bbcc38"><span data-lake-id="uc0f071d9" id="uc0f071d9">in/out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf26e0b68" id="uf26e0b68"><p data-lake-id="ud097cc7f" id="ud097cc7f"><code data-lake-id="u9808cd87" id="u9808cd87"><span data-lake-id="uae56a7ba" id="uae56a7ba">DCacheToSbufferIO</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9b1dd4aa" id="u9b1dd4aa"><p data-lake-id="u602e9feb" id="u602e9feb"><span data-lake-id="uccbcb56d" id="uccbcb56d">StoreQueue 配对并提交后，由 StoreBuffer 送来的 store</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u3737435c" id="u3737435c"><td data-lake-id="uaf167cb4" id="uaf167cb4"><p data-lake-id="u5457322d" id="u5457322d"><span data-lake-id="u5574b4fd" id="u5574b4fd">atomics</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud49ec487" id="ud49ec487"><p data-lake-id="u6a6f3d98" id="u6a6f3d98"><span data-lake-id="u1293043f" id="u1293043f">in/out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub3b7166a" id="ub3b7166a"><p data-lake-id="ub10e8be7" id="ub10e8be7"><code data-lake-id="u13dd4e2e" id="u13dd4e2e"><span data-lake-id="u68e5ca0f" id="u68e5ca0f">AtomicWordIO</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5b309e0a" id="u5b309e0a"><p data-lake-id="uf959635f" id="uf959635f"><span data-lake-id="u51fef8f0" id="u51fef8f0">LR、SC、AMO、AMOCAS。不走 LoadPipe，也不走 StoreBuffer</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4f1fb959" id="u4f1fb959"><td data-lake-id="ubb9bf1ec" id="ubb9bf1ec"><p data-lake-id="ud5cca8a5" id="ud5cca8a5"><span data-lake-id="u4cfdf1bd" id="u4cfdf1bd">cmoReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5ce78cf4" id="u5ce78cf4"><p data-lake-id="uf03d2b73" id="uf03d2b73"><span data-lake-id="u4dacda31" id="u4dacda31">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u09a0afea" id="u09a0afea"><p data-lake-id="u62746c73" id="u62746c73"><span data-lake-id="u94665f2b" id="u94665f2b">Decoupled</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u30161a92" id="u30161a92"><p data-lake-id="ue27945f5" id="ue27945f5"><span data-lake-id="ub3bd0adf" id="ub3bd0adf">StoreQueue 排空 StoreBuffer 之后送来。同一时间只有一条</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u24e6cb28" id="u24e6cb28"><td data-lake-id="ud95bb7ae" id="ud95bb7ae"><p data-lake-id="u8680ad6d" id="u8680ad6d"><span data-lake-id="u51e0021c" id="u51e0021c">cmoResp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7b68af40" id="u7b68af40"><p data-lake-id="ucbe5aa36" id="ucbe5aa36"><span data-lake-id="u14e6cf59" id="u14e6cf59">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud78343a9" id="ud78343a9"><p data-lake-id="u7e8187b4" id="u7e8187b4"><span data-lake-id="u51b2e79d" id="u51b2e79d">Decoupled</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1d00cab2" id="u1d00cab2"><p data-lake-id="u0866823b" id="u0866823b"><span data-lake-id="u2f409cc1" id="u2f409cc1">收到 CompCMO 之后才返回给 StoreQueue</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc0f79552" id="uc0f79552"><td data-lake-id="ub6f9c2d5" id="ub6f9c2d5"><p data-lake-id="u3e855b65" id="u3e855b65"><span data-lake-id="u9c580397" id="u9c580397">wfi.req</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uff423bc5" id="uff423bc5"><p data-lake-id="u07101de4" id="u07101de4"><span data-lake-id="uc4f2579b" id="uc4f2579b">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0f4f6ade" id="u0f4f6ade"><p data-lake-id="uf7bd8f44" id="uf7bd8f44"><span data-lake-id="u42bcb782" id="u42bcb782">Bool</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucedb05c3" id="ucedb05c3"><p data-lake-id="u2869ddb6" id="u2869ddb6"><span data-lake-id="ud43b3500" id="ud43b3500">ROB 请求 DCache 检查能否休眠</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u08ee1e79" id="u08ee1e79"><td data-lake-id="u7b2233b1" id="u7b2233b1"><p data-lake-id="u204028fb" id="u204028fb"><span data-lake-id="u52922800" id="u52922800">wfi.safe</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6c8b5e10" id="u6c8b5e10"><p data-lake-id="uc76d708d" id="uc76d708d"><span data-lake-id="u7baa3dbe" id="u7baa3dbe">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u03bb4bcb" id="u03bb4bcb"><p data-lake-id="ud924a825" id="ud924a825"><span data-lake-id="u61e57d63" id="u61e57d63">Bool</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubbf9494d" id="ubbf9494d"><p data-lake-id="u6d6f86d0" id="u6d6f86d0"><span data-lake-id="ud40ce3bf" id="ud40ce3bf">没有未完成的 MSHR、CMO 和 CompAck。不是“已经进入休眠”</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 data-lake-id="Bxi2e" id="Bxi2e"><span data-lake-id="ucc526270" id="ucc526270">DCacheLoadIO</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u266d7a30" id="u266d7a30"><span data-lake-id="u6525252b" id="u6525252b">每条 LoadPipe 一套。方向按 DCache 看。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u03619809" id="u03619809"><span data-lake-id="ue73f31a5" id="ue73f31a5">s0 的 </span><code data-lake-id="ub1e65936" id="ub1e65936"><span data-lake-id="ue0e2c854" id="ue0e2c854">req</span></code><span data-lake-id="uda120cd2" id="uda120cd2">：</span></p><table data-lake-id="AjBrz" id="AjBrz" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ubb3631eb" id="ubb3631eb"><td data-lake-id="uf6c6e625" id="uf6c6e625"><p data-lake-id="u3392fe9a" id="u3392fe9a"><span data-lake-id="u6401ce94" id="u6401ce94">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua0983b76" id="ua0983b76"><p data-lake-id="u3d3ccf42" id="u3d3ccf42"><span data-lake-id="uca0a9de5" id="uca0a9de5">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3888e4e1" id="u3888e4e1"><p data-lake-id="u79105d3a" id="u79105d3a"><span data-lake-id="u84590608" id="u84590608">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u724aeabe" id="u724aeabe"><td data-lake-id="u49932e3f" id="u49932e3f"><p data-lake-id="u6ff09f2c" id="u6ff09f2c"><span data-lake-id="u1c103af8" id="u1c103af8">valid / ready</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf1e78155" id="uf1e78155"><p data-lake-id="u04caa29a" id="u04caa29a"><span data-lake-id="u3aa8c4e0" id="u3aa8c4e0">in / out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0eab367e" id="u0eab367e"><p data-lake-id="u35e83b0f" id="u35e83b0f"><span data-lake-id="uf35c80e5" id="uf35c80e5">LSU 发出，LoadPipe 能收才 ready</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua35b7200" id="ua35b7200"><td data-lake-id="ub4a757d1" id="ub4a757d1"><p data-lake-id="ub22c2fb8" id="ub22c2fb8"><span data-lake-id="u68d6a63b" id="u68d6a63b">cmd</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u118f9c0a" id="u118f9c0a"><p data-lake-id="ub36c3eb2" id="ub36c3eb2"><span data-lake-id="u2bf13ea5" id="u2bf13ea5">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8d4ac81a" id="u8d4ac81a"><p data-lake-id="ue11a718c" id="ue11a718c"><span data-lake-id="ua335a335" id="ua335a335">普通 load、</span><code data-lake-id="uce87ab86" id="uce87ab86"><span data-lake-id="uc3e338a1" id="uc3e338a1">prefetch.r</span></code><span data-lake-id="u3a6da594" id="u3a6da594"> 或 </span><code data-lake-id="u4ce674b8" id="u4ce674b8"><span data-lake-id="uf593dabd" id="uf593dabd">prefetch.w</span></code></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u80839d97" id="u80839d97"><td data-lake-id="ua3fa67af" id="ua3fa67af"><p data-lake-id="u48f1beb5" id="u48f1beb5"><span data-lake-id="u3dba9e73" id="u3dba9e73">vaddr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u217a36bd" id="u217a36bd"><p data-lake-id="ub2d7e886" id="ub2d7e886"><span data-lake-id="u5dce624e" id="u5dce624e">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u19e27a66" id="u19e27a66"><p data-lake-id="uce6bf682" id="uce6bf682"><span data-lake-id="uf2734346" id="uf2734346">虚地址。s0 只用它读 Tag/Meta，这一拍不读 Data</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u97ef1e5f" id="u97ef1e5f"><td data-lake-id="u97820791" id="u97820791"><p data-lake-id="u5f238bdc" id="u5f238bdc"><span data-lake-id="u181b8973" id="u181b8973">id</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7451081d" id="u7451081d"><p data-lake-id="u0a9070ea" id="u0a9070ea"><span data-lake-id="ua772d6e5" id="ua772d6e5">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucc413e2a" id="ucc413e2a"><p data-lake-id="u220f77f1" id="u220f77f1"><span data-lake-id="u187680ef" id="u187680ef">LoadQueue 的请求号，响应和 forward 都带回它</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u8bb9ab01" id="u8bb9ab01"><td data-lake-id="u99efba25" id="u99efba25"><p data-lake-id="u9132ce94" id="u9132ce94"><span data-lake-id="uf2b1a5d8" id="uf2b1a5d8">is128</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5e0533bf" id="u5e0533bf"><p data-lake-id="u7b3af477" id="u7b3af477"><span data-lake-id="u8c2193fd" id="u8c2193fd">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubc173ce9" id="ubc173ce9"><p data-lake-id="ubfcc4da9" id="ubfcc4da9"><span data-lake-id="u5f1bc83b" id="u5f1bc83b">是否跨 bank 的 128 bit 访问</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua07d4477" id="ua07d4477"><td data-lake-id="u690ec046" id="u690ec046"><p data-lake-id="u7ed7c85a" id="u7ed7c85a"><span data-lake-id="uedff52a2" id="uedff52a2">replayCarry</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2d216522" id="u2d216522"><p data-lake-id="ueb2815eb" id="ueb2815eb"><span data-lake-id="u1a33409f" id="u1a33409f">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u03345753" id="u03345753"><p data-lake-id="uffdc9938" id="uffdc9938"><span data-lake-id="uf021c47d" id="uf021c47d">上次 bank 冲突 replay 带来的信息。</span><code data-lake-id="u7f9f84fe" id="u7f9f84fe"><span data-lake-id="u66ee6698" id="u66ee6698">valid</span></code><span data-lake-id="ub934a02b" id="ub934a02b"> 和独热 </span><code data-lake-id="uba259e5d" id="uba259e5d"><span data-lake-id="ua51fb04e" id="ua51fb04e">real_way</span></code><span data-lake-id="u487552e0" id="u487552e0">。重发仍从 Tag 比较开始，不用这份 way 直接读 Data</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="ub12b280a" id="ub12b280a"><span data-lake-id="u2754d7f3" id="u2754d7f3">s1 由 LSU 送回翻译结果：</span></p><table data-lake-id="q8HDJ" id="q8HDJ" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u4f274292" id="u4f274292"><td data-lake-id="u0360a503" id="u0360a503"><p data-lake-id="u7085d1e5" id="u7085d1e5"><span data-lake-id="u0d0d5c79" id="u0d0d5c79">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf8d34271" id="uf8d34271"><p data-lake-id="u4bd6f8fb" id="u4bd6f8fb"><span data-lake-id="u2f9977be" id="u2f9977be">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub1adef0c" id="ub1adef0c"><p data-lake-id="u484f328e" id="u484f328e"><span data-lake-id="ue02899cd" id="ue02899cd">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4bea7f57" id="u4bea7f57"><td data-lake-id="u29e91046" id="u29e91046"><p data-lake-id="u7b075297" id="u7b075297"><span data-lake-id="u7aeff7dc" id="u7aeff7dc">s1_paddr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1b4ac7eb" id="u1b4ac7eb"><p data-lake-id="u5e3c888e" id="u5e3c888e"><span data-lake-id="ua96877f2" id="ua96877f2">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucfdb49bb" id="ucfdb49bb"><p data-lake-id="u630c60cd" id="u630c60cd"><span data-lake-id="u94b06da5" id="u94b06da5">MMU 给出的物理地址。s1 用它比 Tag</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ufefe2cd2" id="ufefe2cd2"><td data-lake-id="u45b3aa33" id="u45b3aa33"><p data-lake-id="u79350f14" id="u79350f14"><span data-lake-id="ud3741ae4" id="ud3741ae4">s1_kill</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9d0f4032" id="u9d0f4032"><p data-lake-id="u7536ac6b" id="u7536ac6b"><span data-lake-id="u92aefdba" id="u92aefdba">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf8aafc7e" id="uf8aafc7e"><p data-lake-id="u00d0c16e" id="u00d0c16e"><span data-lake-id="u7931ca70" id="u7931ca70">TLB miss 或异常，取消这条请求</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua918d913" id="ua918d913"><td data-lake-id="uec49ec7d" id="uec49ec7d"><p data-lake-id="u80e7b977" id="u80e7b977"><span data-lake-id="u4b3ed850" id="u4b3ed850">s2_kill</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud3ab0d89" id="ud3ab0d89"><p data-lake-id="u32e57c70" id="u32e57c70"><span data-lake-id="u0a47192b" id="u0a47192b">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u24509269" id="u24509269"><p data-lake-id="u6a9c8340" id="u6a9c8340"><span data-lake-id="u9a98c969" id="u9a98c969">access fault 或 MMIO。MMIO 改走 Uncache，不在 LoadPipe 里完成</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u93ab62b8" id="u93ab62b8"><code data-lake-id="u2457f6c3" id="u2457f6c3"><span data-lake-id="ucd2df80c" id="ucd2df80c">resp</span></code><span data-lake-id="u8bbd0c24" id="u8bbd0c24"> 在 s2 给出，三种结果互斥：</span></p><table data-lake-id="QxfKX" id="QxfKX" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u61322cf8" id="u61322cf8"><td data-lake-id="u85e9a3e5" id="u85e9a3e5"><p data-lake-id="u1fc4f654" id="u1fc4f654"><span data-lake-id="u7cd03ff2" id="u7cd03ff2">结果</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf041825d" id="uf041825d"><p data-lake-id="u41373492" id="u41373492"><span data-lake-id="uda337f6e" id="uda337f6e">条件</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1202427a" id="u1202427a"><p data-lake-id="u229ef48d" id="u229ef48d"><span data-lake-id="uedf30bed" id="uedf30bed">DCache 怎么回答</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub59a1757" id="ub59a1757"><td data-lake-id="u39543af4" id="u39543af4"><p data-lake-id="u86594b8e" id="u86594b8e"><span data-lake-id="ub748b2ca" id="ub748b2ca">hit</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8e677744" id="u8e677744"><p data-lake-id="u62ccf6db" id="u62ccf6db"><span data-lake-id="u64a689c1" id="u64a689c1">普通 load 命中且权限够；</span><code data-lake-id="u26771c64" id="u26771c64"><span data-lake-id="u03657285" id="u03657285">prefetch.r</span></code><span data-lake-id="u360bc56c" id="u360bc56c"> 遇到 SC、UC、UD；</span><code data-lake-id="ue141346d" id="ue141346d"><span data-lake-id="u471f2d1f" id="u471f2d1f">prefetch.w</span></code><span data-lake-id="u76a74d0f" id="u76a74d0f"> 遇到 UC、UD</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8580bacc" id="u8580bacc"><p data-lake-id="uf864b1a5" id="uf864b1a5"><span data-lake-id="u7af46c6d" id="u7af46c6d">普通 load 返回命中数据，64 bit，跨 bank 时 128 bit。预取不返回数据，也不读 Data</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uf90156c0" id="uf90156c0" style="height: 115px"><td data-lake-id="u6ea03822" id="u6ea03822"><p data-lake-id="ud8626aeb" id="ud8626aeb"><span data-lake-id="u1e5630c5" id="u1e5630c5">accept</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u798deda8" id="u798deda8"><p data-lake-id="u013195c7" id="u013195c7"><span data-lake-id="u4d0a0b82" id="u4d0a0b82">miss 或权限不够，并且 MissQueue 这拍接收</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud80394b1" id="ud80394b1"><p data-lake-id="u26385ca3" id="u26385ca3"><code data-lake-id="u9cf04968" id="u9cf04968"><span data-lake-id="uc673762d" id="uc673762d">handled=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="ufdd14efe" id="ufdd14efe">，带回 </span><code data-lake-id="uf85a3a74" id="uf85a3a74"><span data-lake-id="uaf4d7551" id="uaf4d7551">mshr_id</span></code><span data-lake-id="ua9bf0ca8" id="ua9bf0ca8">。新分配和合并都算接住。LoadPipe 到这里结束，行要等后面的 refill 才安装</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc3460ff8" id="uc3460ff8" style="height: 115px"><td data-lake-id="u9a0c95a9" id="u9a0c95a9"><p data-lake-id="u9752bc2a" id="u9752bc2a"><span data-lake-id="u4cda3aa4" id="u4cda3aa4">replay</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf3921a1f" id="uf3921a1f"><p data-lake-id="u0968370a" id="u0968370a"><span data-lake-id="u414d8818" id="u414d8818">普通 load 不接受</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u91528149" id="u91528149"><p data-lake-id="uc62f28ff" id="uc62f28ff"><code data-lake-id="u33a60d21" id="u33a60d21"><span data-lake-id="uf4dc61ec" id="uf4dc61ec">replay=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="uedca9f33" id="uedca9f33">。原因是 bank 冲突、MSHR 拒绝，或同地址行还在 WritebackQueue。bank 冲突时 </span><code data-lake-id="uf49b2ea3" id="uf49b2ea3"><span data-lake-id="u01b783d0" id="u01b783d0">replayCarry.valid=1</span></code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u3dfc489e" id="u3dfc489e"><code data-lake-id="ucf4f099b" id="ucf4f099b"><span data-lake-id="ucbe015ea" id="ucbe015ea">prefetch.w</span></code><span data-lake-id="u6fd06504" id="u6fd06504"> 命中 SC 不算 hit，因为没有写权限，按 miss 发 ReadUnique。软件预取被 MissQueue 拒绝、被 </span><code data-lake-id="ua4e8bc0d" id="ua4e8bc0d"><span data-lake-id="uabfd7426" id="uabfd7426">wbBlock</span></code><span data-lake-id="u2cc69350" id="u2cc69350"> 挡住，或这一拍 </span><code data-lake-id="uf9e05025" id="uf9e05025"><span data-lake-id="u3d5d032e" id="u3d5d032e">missReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="u676fd209" id="u676fd209"> 没被选中，都直接结束，</span><code data-lake-id="uc6677947" id="uc6677947"><span data-lake-id="u391ea374" id="u391ea374">replay=0</span></code><span data-lake-id="ua361f1d3" id="ua361f1d3">。普通 load 在同样情况下重发。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua9eb629c" id="ua9eb629c"><span data-lake-id="u60763b3a" id="u60763b3a">权限不够时，s2 才向 MissQueue 发 </span><code data-lake-id="u25192d18" id="u25192d18"><span data-lake-id="u60e350f3" id="u60e350f3">missReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="ue71d707b" id="ue71d707b">。</span><code data-lake-id="u9fdc5f2a" id="u9fdc5f2a"><span data-lake-id="ueb81de26" id="ueb81de26">prefetch.r</span></code><span data-lake-id="ue77fcfae" id="ue77fcfae"> 和普通 load 由 MissQueue 发 ReadShared；</span><code data-lake-id="uf3079de8" id="uf3079de8"><span data-lake-id="ucd764b26" id="ucd764b26">prefetch.w</span></code><span data-lake-id="ua28065b6" id="ua28065b6"> 发 ReadUnique。这里不选 victim。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id="pDxkp" id="pDxkp"><span data-lake-id="ua064e592" id="ua064e592">forward 和 refill_wakeup</span></h4><p data-lake-id="uce68e128" id="uce68e128"><span data-lake-id="ub43ffb4d" id="ub43ffb4d">这两路都是 DCache 给 LoadUnit 的，两条 LoadPipe 各一套。</span></p><table data-lake-id="BK4ZJ" id="BK4ZJ" class="lake-table" style="width: 538.5px"><colgroup><col width="145"><col width="100"><col width="106"><col width="187.5"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ua4823b4b" id="ua4823b4b"><td data-lake-id="ua6cf7834" id="ua6cf7834"><p data-lake-id="u70bae223" id="u70bae223"><span data-lake-id="u4516ff11" id="u4516ff11">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf61da777" id="uf61da777"><p data-lake-id="u8892fd73" id="u8892fd73"><span data-lake-id="uf85c4107" id="uf85c4107">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9de5626c" id="u9de5626c"><p data-lake-id="uc245adb4" id="uc245adb4"><span data-lake-id="ub3d12316" id="ub3d12316">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u88f32a9f" id="u88f32a9f"><p data-lake-id="u88861212" id="u88861212"><span data-lake-id="u5cf787ba" id="u5cf787ba">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u9aeb489c" id="u9aeb489c"><td data-lake-id="uab1f4bda" id="uab1f4bda"><p data-lake-id="u16e36530" id="u16e36530"><span data-lake-id="ua59f05eb" id="ua59f05eb">forward_chi</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8e5886ed" id="u8e5886ed"><p data-lake-id="u195f0322" id="u195f0322"><span data-lake-id="u32d6b3a7" id="u32d6b3a7">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u460741c0" id="u460741c0"><p data-lake-id="ub5583268" id="ub5583268"><span data-lake-id="u9eac6afb" id="u9eac6afb">Valid</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4fa2ff03" id="u4fa2ff03"><p data-lake-id="u6ec6b9e4" id="u6ec6b9e4"><span data-lake-id="u6ffc5569" id="u6ffc5569">RXDAT 到达的当拍，把该 load 要的那一半送出。</span><code data-lake-id="uf230b0d8" id="uf230b0d8"><span data-lake-id="u344dd83a" id="u344dd83a">addr[5]=0</span></code><span data-lake-id="u325c75f4" id="u325c75f4"> 是低 32B，</span><code data-lake-id="ub01c67ae" id="ub01c67ae"><span data-lake-id="uebe2abdd" id="uebe2abdd">addr[5]=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="u7781863e" id="u7781863e"> 是高 32B。不等写入 DataArray</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u48c07f81" id="u48c07f81"><td data-lake-id="u885f56d0" id="u885f56d0"><p data-lake-id="u4b948e2d" id="u4b948e2d"><span data-lake-id="u3efb6227" id="u3efb6227">forward_mshr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua569c5c5" id="ua569c5c5"><p data-lake-id="u3026c9e2" id="u3026c9e2"><span data-lake-id="u5d710a79" id="u5d710a79">LSU 查询，DCache 回答</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uffe661ce" id="uffe661ce"><p data-lake-id="u7d0f1f0e" id="u7d0f1f0e"><span data-lake-id="uf387d398" id="uf387d398">missId、地址、半行选择</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6767a5e8" id="u6767a5e8"><p data-lake-id="u5b6023b7" id="u5b6023b7"><span data-lake-id="u04656787" id="u04656787">读已经在 MSHR buffer 里的那一半。还没到则结果无效，不能用另一半凑</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u8f57f7b0" id="u8f57f7b0"><td data-lake-id="uda125b32" id="uda125b32"><p data-lake-id="u9db859ee" id="u9db859ee"><span data-lake-id="u018444a7" id="u018444a7">refill_wakeup</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u52dc006f" id="u52dc006f"><p data-lake-id="u57a6a6f3" id="u57a6a6f3"><span data-lake-id="u1874bcd9" id="u1874bcd9">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubccd3698" id="ubccd3698"><p data-lake-id="uf0a3664b" id="uf0a3664b"><span data-lake-id="u54ae36f9" id="u54ae36f9">Valid，</span><code data-lake-id="u59f72cd8" id="u59f72cd8"><span data-lake-id="u1cf6891f" id="u1cf6891f">mshr_id</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub80404b6" id="ub80404b6"><p data-lake-id="ufc9ddab8" id="ufc9ddab8"><span data-lake-id="u26af0696" id="u26af0696">行已经安装成 SC、UC 或 UD。没收到 forward 的 load 可以重发，这次应命中。不带 64B 数据</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u4ce64bd5" id="u4ce64bd5"><code data-lake-id="u12dbccc1" id="u12dbccc1"><span data-lake-id="uf050d465" id="uf050d465">forward_chi</span></code><span data-lake-id="ub8ecf4bf" id="ub8ecf4bf"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id="u793ef11d" id="u793ef11d"><span data-lake-id="u3f0b8595" id="u3f0b8595">forward_mshr</span></code><span data-lake-id="u18066d32" id="u18066d32"> 都带 </span><code data-lake-id="ub5a582c4" id="ub5a582c4"><span data-lake-id="uac7b592c" id="uac7b592c">id</span></code><span data-lake-id="ub894ab45" id="ub894ab45"> 或 </span><code data-lake-id="ue672e532" id="ue672e532"><span data-lake-id="ue1f3f4a3" id="ue1f3f4a3">mshr_id</span></code><span data-lake-id="u1271ecc8" id="u1271ecc8">、数据和 valid。store mask 已经盖过的字节，forward 出去的是盖过之后的数据。store、原子和软件预取不向前递。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf091f87d" id="uf091f87d"><span data-lake-id="uff391eb9" id="uff391eb9">数据刚进 MSHR 不算唤醒。Snoop 让这次回填放弃安装时不发 </span><code data-lake-id="u2babade3" id="u2babade3"><span data-lake-id="u910d70ec" id="u910d70ec">refill_wakeup</span></code><span data-lake-id="u91cc1f8a" id="u91cc1f8a">，原来的 load 以后按 miss 重来。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="uWNVE" id="uWNVE"><span data-lake-id="ue27cdcd0" id="ue27cdcd0">DCacheToSbufferIO</span></h3><p data-lake-id="uab13dff9" id="uab13dff9"><span data-lake-id="u1aac0cc0" id="u1aac0cc0">StoreBuffer 把地址和数据都准备好之后才进入 MainPipe 的 store 口。DCache 不提供 STA 的 Tag 查询口。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2248c91b" id="u2248c91b"><code data-lake-id="u87525165" id="u87525165"><span data-lake-id="u40a3af9d" id="u40a3af9d">req</span></code><span data-lake-id="u733eaab9" id="u733eaab9">：</span></p><table data-lake-id="vgOiE" id="vgOiE" class="lake-table" style="width: 540px"><colgroup><col width="141"><col width="122"><col width="277"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u08d6333a" id="u08d6333a"><td data-lake-id="ufd197802" id="ufd197802"><p data-lake-id="u104e0b1c" id="u104e0b1c"><span data-lake-id="ubc30bef9" id="ubc30bef9">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9904879b" id="u9904879b"><p data-lake-id="u5d2ca8b0" id="u5d2ca8b0"><span data-lake-id="u891f2966" id="u891f2966">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u15c97407" id="u15c97407"><p data-lake-id="uabde35f0" id="uabde35f0"><span data-lake-id="u6ff0261a" id="u6ff0261a">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1050217a" id="u1050217a"><td data-lake-id="u09b860b4" id="u09b860b4"><p data-lake-id="u54072540" id="u54072540"><span data-lake-id="u5e9caa64" id="u5e9caa64">valid / ready</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf5bf8a63" id="uf5bf8a63"><p data-lake-id="ub444080f" id="ub444080f"><span data-lake-id="u5d7588dc" id="u5d7588dc">in / out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8ef96593" id="u8ef96593"><p data-lake-id="uf3460552" id="uf3460552"><span data-lake-id="u9f6b0150" id="u9f6b0150">StoreBuffer 发出。MainPipe 的 store 口这拍能仲裁进去才 ready</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc6f5e351" id="uc6f5e351"><td data-lake-id="u307b26fc" id="u307b26fc"><p data-lake-id="uc2521940" id="uc2521940"><span data-lake-id="u69c4ab27" id="u69c4ab27">id</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud032be8e" id="ud032be8e"><p data-lake-id="u2fe811be" id="u2fe811be"><span data-lake-id="uf31021d3" id="uf31021d3">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udbd93721" id="udbd93721"><p data-lake-id="u2bf33f30" id="u2bf33f30"><span data-lake-id="u39b13ae0" id="u39b13ae0">StoreBuffer 项号，响应原样带回</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4aac11d1" id="u4aac11d1"><td data-lake-id="uf7c3ee29" id="uf7c3ee29"><p data-lake-id="u52a803bd" id="u52a803bd"><span data-lake-id="u7d0f2b91" id="u7d0f2b91">cmd</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub1853176" id="ub1853176"><p data-lake-id="u9564c3e2" id="u9564c3e2"><span data-lake-id="ue8835008" id="ue8835008">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2b11b973" id="u2b11b973"><p data-lake-id="ue76f59de" id="ue76f59de"><span data-lake-id="u7ee8fcc8" id="u7ee8fcc8">普通 store。整行覆盖和部分写都走这里，用 mask 区分</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u886b3d18" id="u886b3d18"><td data-lake-id="u55767546" id="u55767546"><p data-lake-id="u215405eb" id="u215405eb"><span data-lake-id="u1e0af24f" id="u1e0af24f">addr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5264d6cb" id="u5264d6cb"><p data-lake-id="u3fff688d" id="u3fff688d"><span data-lake-id="u804112fb" id="u804112fb">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1efbd9de" id="u1efbd9de"><p data-lake-id="u7003ed91" id="u7003ed91"><span data-lake-id="u0405e605" id="u0405e605">64B 对齐的物理地址</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u80d8a2c1" id="u80d8a2c1"><td data-lake-id="u1199f84b" id="u1199f84b"><p data-lake-id="ua3c243ef" id="ua3c243ef"><span data-lake-id="u8120c5eb" id="u8120c5eb">vaddr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8e025e37" id="u8e025e37"><p data-lake-id="ub8335611" id="ub8335611"><span data-lake-id="u8d7a6518" id="u8d7a6518">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc6d02fb9" id="uc6d02fb9"><p data-lake-id="u78d6790a" id="u78d6790a"><span data-lake-id="u8a9ee4e2" id="u8a9ee4e2">提供 </span><code data-lake-id="u769de593" id="u769de593"><span data-lake-id="u9606d269" id="u9606d269">vaddr[13:12]</span></code><span data-lake-id="ude5584a2" id="ude5584a2"> 作为 alias，以及 set index。不能从物理地址还原 alias</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ue7fa5108" id="ue7fa5108"><td data-lake-id="u43da575f" id="u43da575f"><p data-lake-id="ue6b8ccda" id="ue6b8ccda"><span data-lake-id="uf83048f8" id="uf83048f8">data</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud6e44824" id="ud6e44824"><p data-lake-id="ud6e7455a" id="ud6e7455a"><span data-lake-id="uf5b6cc7b" id="uf5b6cc7b">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u81142228" id="u81142228"><p data-lake-id="u62398c2a" id="u62398c2a"><span data-lake-id="u0ad826d7" id="u0ad826d7">64B</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4282ed81" id="u4282ed81"><td data-lake-id="u8dff1b94" id="u8dff1b94"><p data-lake-id="u7270fbba" id="u7270fbba"><span data-lake-id="ua382561e" id="ua382561e">mask</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ued4dec8c" id="ued4dec8c"><p data-lake-id="u7c9a0976" id="u7c9a0976"><span data-lake-id="u87c4a7ba" id="u87c4a7ba">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf76efa28" id="uf76efa28"><p data-lake-id="u2d926ca3" id="u2d926ca3"><span data-lake-id="u68b4cf83" id="u68b4cf83">64 bit，每位对应一个字节。全 1 表示整行覆盖，MissQueue 才用 MakeUnique</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="uf5872e3a" id="uf5872e3a"><span data-lake-id="u4f8a78e0" id="u4f8a78e0">响应只有成功或重发，miss 的那一拍不回成功：</span></p><table data-lake-id="CMWXx" id="CMWXx" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u2c04787a" id="u2c04787a"><td data-lake-id="u48b76f7d" id="u48b76f7d"><p data-lake-id="u18843bfe" id="u18843bfe"><span data-lake-id="u8b368241" id="u8b368241">结果</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue75bf506" id="ue75bf506"><p data-lake-id="ua44cc11f" id="ua44cc11f"><span data-lake-id="u1cd01405" id="u1cd01405">时机</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0d49033f" id="u0d49033f"><p data-lake-id="u26ff001e" id="u26ff001e"><span data-lake-id="uf205bdbf" id="uf205bdbf">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u28312adf" id="u28312adf"><td data-lake-id="u09b57214" id="u09b57214"><p data-lake-id="u625cb7eb" id="u625cb7eb"><span data-lake-id="u3303786d" id="u3303786d">hit 成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7dff7521" id="u7dff7521"><p data-lake-id="ua58ae247" id="ua58ae247"><span data-lake-id="u3b2c1196" id="u3b2c1196">store 流水的 s3</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u80721fcd" id="u80721fcd"><p data-lake-id="u1eea25f9" id="u1eea25f9"><span data-lake-id="ue9128315" id="ue9128315">命中且有写权限，数据和 Meta 已经写入</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u427e4872" id="u427e4872"><td data-lake-id="u5cf31aaf" id="u5cf31aaf"><p data-lake-id="u507a6aed" id="u507a6aed"><span data-lake-id="u9546eb36" id="u9546eb36">miss 成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucbda20f5" id="ucbda20f5"><p data-lake-id="u149b95ad" id="u149b95ad"><span data-lake-id="ueb3c0801" id="ueb3c0801">这次 refill 的 s3</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u12ff0f5b" id="u12ff0f5b"><p data-lake-id="u8a03cfd8" id="u8a03cfd8"><span data-lake-id="u611df058" id="u611df058">行已经安装，需要交出的 victim 也已经进 WritebackQueue</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1d497afd" id="u1d497afd"><td data-lake-id="u943a85bc" id="u943a85bc"><p data-lake-id="uffc631d1" id="uffc631d1"><span data-lake-id="ud381a354" id="ud381a354">replay</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufcd33775" id="ufcd33775"><p data-lake-id="u38fddea6" id="u38fddea6"><span data-lake-id="u9c9ad34b" id="u9c9ad34b">s2 不能发 </span><code data-lake-id="u012ee89a" id="u012ee89a"><span data-lake-id="ue9d20808" id="ue9d20808">missReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="u4d1dd79e" id="u4d1dd79e">，或 MissQueue 拒绝</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uedc67088" id="uedc67088"><p data-lake-id="u4f3686e6" id="u4f3686e6"><span data-lake-id="udd056616" id="udd056616">MSHR 拒绝、同地址写回还在 WritebackQueue、way 占用冲突。StoreBuffer 以后重发。s3 不写 array</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 data-lake-id="wKFfp" id="wKFfp"><span data-lake-id="u72739e80" id="u72739e80">AtomicWordIO</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ubd6e1e66" id="ubd6e1e66"><span data-lake-id="u78bb5e61" id="u78bb5e61">LR、SC、AMO、AMOCAS 从 AtomicsUnit 进入 MainPipe 的 atomic 口。第一次查找不走 LoadPipe，也不走 StoreBuffer。miss 时 s2 发 </span><code data-lake-id="uc860ddd6" id="uc860ddd6"><span data-lake-id="ue9e9b8f9" id="ue9e9b8f9">missReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="ub7b6c4d3" id="ub7b6c4d3">；数据回来后不再进 atomic，改走 refill，在同一次 s3 里安装并完成运算，然后给 AtomicsUnit 响应。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u54c00a4f" id="u54c00a4f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e45e47b" id="u8e45e47b">原子指令执行期间，核内不再向 DCache 发 load、store 或另一条原子。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4566bc94" id="u4566bc94"><code data-lake-id="u62277aed" id="u62277aed"><span data-lake-id="uc40cf64e" id="uc40cf64e">req</span></code><span data-lake-id="u520dbc2f" id="u520dbc2f">：</span></p><table data-lake-id="sJxZ3" id="sJxZ3" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u56dc5c71" id="u56dc5c71"><td data-lake-id="u0e7deb7c" id="u0e7deb7c"><p data-lake-id="uc9424e79" id="uc9424e79"><span data-lake-id="u0370504d" id="u0370504d">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u25fc25d0" id="u25fc25d0"><p data-lake-id="u5ae76aa5" id="u5ae76aa5"><span data-lake-id="uf8927bb5" id="uf8927bb5">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3faeb3cc" id="u3faeb3cc"><p data-lake-id="ue6a1fbcb" id="ue6a1fbcb"><span data-lake-id="u54c93730" id="u54c93730">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uad5c1ca4" id="uad5c1ca4"><td data-lake-id="u02cf7e8d" id="u02cf7e8d"><p data-lake-id="u753f9a82" id="u753f9a82"><span data-lake-id="u0aae8bdd" id="u0aae8bdd">valid / ready</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uef50ba1a" id="uef50ba1a"><p data-lake-id="u20ae8d50" id="u20ae8d50"><span data-lake-id="u9cee9bd5" id="u9cee9bd5">in / out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue3324695" id="ue3324695"><p data-lake-id="ub1c3822c" id="ub1c3822c"><span data-lake-id="ubbaf8785" id="ubbaf8785">AtomicsUnit 发出，atomic 口接受才 ready</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua29bffec" id="ua29bffec"><td data-lake-id="uc4ae60fe" id="uc4ae60fe"><p data-lake-id="ucb44f3a3" id="ucb44f3a3"><span data-lake-id="uef64682b" id="uef64682b">id</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udf13f80d" id="udf13f80d"><p data-lake-id="ufbce063c" id="ufbce063c"><span data-lake-id="ud2c18df3" id="ud2c18df3">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub02e38eb" id="ub02e38eb"><p data-lake-id="ucac63304" id="ucac63304"><span data-lake-id="ub52f08bd" id="ub52f08bd">响应原样带回</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ufe713bec" id="ufe713bec"><td data-lake-id="ua065c6f8" id="ua065c6f8"><p data-lake-id="uf896eda0" id="uf896eda0"><span data-lake-id="uef1dbe11" id="uef1dbe11">cmd</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9f420d7a" id="u9f420d7a"><p data-lake-id="u5e79b3c0" id="u5e79b3c0"><span data-lake-id="u27dc0675" id="u27dc0675">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc7c167b1" id="uc7c167b1"><p data-lake-id="u922ccda9" id="u922ccda9"><span data-lake-id="u7a4a123c" id="u7a4a123c">LR、SC、AMO 或 AMOCAS</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u5261dec5" id="u5261dec5"><td data-lake-id="u4e2588a3" id="u4e2588a3"><p data-lake-id="u95c4dd5f" id="u95c4dd5f"><span data-lake-id="u1c34cb24" id="u1c34cb24">addr / vaddr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uce7a8c59" id="uce7a8c59"><p data-lake-id="ueab85dfd" id="ueab85dfd"><span data-lake-id="ubbe42db3" id="ubbe42db3">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u81a98cf7" id="u81a98cf7"><p data-lake-id="u44acf2c6" id="u44acf2c6"><span data-lake-id="u5923b235" id="u5923b235">物理地址，以及 alias </span><code data-lake-id="u7312ef00" id="u7312ef00"><span data-lake-id="u9863df32" id="u9863df32">vaddr[13:12]</span></code></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u8c984e02" id="u8c984e02"><td data-lake-id="u21adbc04" id="u21adbc04"><p data-lake-id="u9c981fbf" id="u9c981fbf"><span data-lake-id="uf4aaae51" id="uf4aaae51">amoData / amoMask</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u92c484b2" id="u92c484b2"><p data-lake-id="ua7f73e14" id="ua7f73e14"><span data-lake-id="u919a0960" id="u919a0960">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9b96f17f" id="u9b96f17f"><p data-lake-id="u0f7cac61" id="u0f7cac61"><span data-lake-id="ud258f27b" id="ud258f27b">写数据和字节掩码。最大 128 bit</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2d526c93" id="u2d526c93"><td data-lake-id="u9b0cf5a7" id="u9b0cf5a7"><p data-lake-id="u0cec41da" id="u0cec41da"><span data-lake-id="uad81822f" id="uad81822f">amoCmp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9bb59608" id="u9bb59608"><p data-lake-id="u7adf31ce" id="u7adf31ce"><span data-lake-id="uc7eb178b" id="uc7eb178b">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubd303802" id="ubd303802"><p data-lake-id="u1e825811" id="u1e825811"><span data-lake-id="u4c2d3304" id="u4c2d3304">只有 AMOCAS 使用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua92fcf1c" id="ua92fcf1c"><td data-lake-id="ub0a9ed1b" id="ub0a9ed1b"><p data-lake-id="u24054a9c" id="u24054a9c"><span data-lake-id="u19d79fed" id="u19d79fed">wordIdx</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2201814c" id="u2201814c"><p data-lake-id="u07a6f36d" id="u07a6f36d"><span data-lake-id="u7713e528" id="u7713e528">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubccc5434" id="ubccc5434"><p data-lake-id="u3690888f" id="u3690888f"><span data-lake-id="u122e3f16" id="u122e3f16">操作落在哪一个 64 bit bank</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u128fabae" id="u128fabae"><code data-lake-id="ub00cf4e8" id="ub00cf4e8"><span data-lake-id="u60f1ca02" id="u60f1ca02">resp</span></code><span data-lake-id="u8c095451" id="u8c095451">：</span></p><table data-lake-id="V5gDM" id="V5gDM" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="uc63889f5" id="uc63889f5"><td data-lake-id="u1d15ae1a" id="u1d15ae1a"><p data-lake-id="u75ee0bba" id="u75ee0bba"><span data-lake-id="ub4c2980a" id="ub4c2980a">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue9545a44" id="ue9545a44"><p data-lake-id="u78b26ef3" id="u78b26ef3"><span data-lake-id="u8e77eb0c" id="u8e77eb0c">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uea880edf" id="uea880edf"><p data-lake-id="u445f393f" id="u445f393f"><span data-lake-id="uf59e8382" id="uf59e8382">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2c4290b6" id="u2c4290b6"><td data-lake-id="u27fb2dc7" id="u27fb2dc7"><p data-lake-id="u359ea959" id="u359ea959"><span data-lake-id="u2f990bac" id="u2f990bac">valid / ready</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u46d58197" id="u46d58197"><p data-lake-id="u7a410b95" id="u7a410b95"><span data-lake-id="u9f26248f" id="u9f26248f">out / in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uaae07725" id="uaae07725"><p data-lake-id="uf6eb27a3" id="uf6eb27a3"><span data-lake-id="u97162013" id="u97162013">运算或失败结果已经确定才 valid</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u212aedc9" id="u212aedc9"><td data-lake-id="ubdb9a396" id="ubdb9a396"><p data-lake-id="u68fdbe71" id="u68fdbe71"><span data-lake-id="ua4399d30" id="ua4399d30">id</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6159843b" id="u6159843b"><p data-lake-id="u4d41919b" id="u4d41919b"><span data-lake-id="uc0e3b68d" id="uc0e3b68d">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u61b6a5cb" id="u61b6a5cb"><p data-lake-id="u02648447" id="u02648447"><span data-lake-id="ua9756f10" id="ua9756f10">对应请求</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ubb254327" id="ubb254327"><td data-lake-id="ua70aca77" id="ua70aca77"><p data-lake-id="u9d86a89f" id="u9d86a89f"><span data-lake-id="u484f94dc" id="u484f94dc">data</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufd6ae1a6" id="ufd6ae1a6"><p data-lake-id="u2e5481f0" id="u2e5481f0"><span data-lake-id="u65ef9f32" id="u65ef9f32">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ueb06d5b1" id="ueb06d5b1"><p data-lake-id="ufa6a2d10" id="ufa6a2d10"><span data-lake-id="uf84b903f" id="uf84b903f">旧值。SC 失败时按约定返回失败标志，不写内存</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub236663b" id="ub236663b"><td data-lake-id="ub1ce9d5c" id="ub1ce9d5c"><p data-lake-id="u13db0085" id="u13db0085"><span data-lake-id="uad103e49" id="uad103e49">success</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u03796f87" id="u03796f87"><p data-lake-id="u6e1e4f47" id="u6e1e4f47"><span data-lake-id="ue9d57def" id="ue9d57def">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2e26a238" id="u2e26a238"><p data-lake-id="ud301faf8" id="ud301faf8"><span data-lake-id="ua7fbc9a5" id="ua7fbc9a5">只有 SC 使用。reservation 检查失败时为 0，并且不创建 MSHR</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u452a3f92" id="u452a3f92"><td data-lake-id="uaa840c57" id="uaa840c57"><p data-lake-id="u44b50962" id="u44b50962"><span data-lake-id="u082b5be0" id="u082b5be0">replay</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u963d2b6c" id="u963d2b6c"><p data-lake-id="u064b3459" id="u064b3459"><span data-lake-id="u6bea2297" id="u6bea2297">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7f832392" id="u7f832392"><p data-lake-id="u43072c9e" id="u43072c9e"><span data-lake-id="u96f55614" id="u96f55614">MissQueue 没接住或被 WritebackQueue 挡住。AtomicsUnit 以后重发，这一拍没有结果</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u9b777d78" id="u9b777d78"><span data-lake-id="u1f0da029" id="u1f0da029">SC 在 MainPipe 里 reservation 检查失败时，不进入 MissQueue。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="aD1Lv" id="aD1Lv"><span data-lake-id="ufc85b59d" id="ufc85b59d">CMO</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u433897b1" id="u433897b1"><span data-lake-id="u50a6a0f9" id="u50a6a0f9">CMO 来自 StoreQueue，不是单独的 CMO 协处理器。StoreQueue 先把 StoreBuffer 排空，再发 </span><code data-lake-id="u4e500cc8" id="u4e500cc8"><span data-lake-id="u05123afc" id="u05123afc">cmoReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="udb1a3060" id="udb1a3060">；排空不是 DCache 的引脚。请求直接进 MissQueue 内部的 CMO 单元，不进 LoadPipe，也不占 MainPipe 的四路仲裁，不占 16 个 MissEntry。</span></p><table data-lake-id="lqNow" id="lqNow" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="187.5"><col width="187.5"><col width="187.5"><col width="187.5"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ub6aecd8c" id="ub6aecd8c"><td data-lake-id="ua3fae757" id="ua3fae757"><p data-lake-id="u5543c276" id="u5543c276"><span data-lake-id="uf184ae8e" id="uf184ae8e">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue85bf629" id="ue85bf629"><p data-lake-id="uc999e8cf" id="uc999e8cf"><span data-lake-id="uef28f580" id="uef28f580">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0a6f3916" id="u0a6f3916"><p data-lake-id="u05e9982a" id="u05e9982a"><span data-lake-id="uf8e68d45" id="uf8e68d45">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7e048057" id="u7e048057"><p data-lake-id="u6bc923eb" id="u6bc923eb"><span data-lake-id="u7756e983" id="u7756e983">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uea3af175" id="uea3af175"><td data-lake-id="ua723618d" id="ua723618d"><p data-lake-id="u015e87c6" id="u015e87c6"><span data-lake-id="u0de88d0f" id="u0de88d0f">cmoReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0596b1ab" id="u0596b1ab"><p data-lake-id="ub63a4a6a" id="ub63a4a6a"><span data-lake-id="u0203085c" id="u0203085c">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7281701f" id="u7281701f"><p data-lake-id="u21fe5372" id="u21fe5372"><span data-lake-id="u9d7851a3" id="u9d7851a3">Decoupled</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua4126829" id="ua4126829"><p data-lake-id="u1bdaa047" id="u1bdaa047"><code data-lake-id="u3deec86b" id="u3deec86b"><span data-lake-id="u60408d86" id="u60408d86">id</span></code><span data-lake-id="u0c49bd9e" id="u0c49bd9e">、</span><code data-lake-id="u2c4b307a" id="u2c4b307a"><span data-lake-id="ucbeefc3f" id="ucbeefc3f">opcode</span></code><span data-lake-id="u78447151" id="u78447151">、64B 对齐的 </span><code data-lake-id="ufe487351" id="ufe487351"><span data-lake-id="u565f2735" id="u565f2735">paddr</span></code><span data-lake-id="u25732740" id="u25732740">、</span><code data-lake-id="u70c72dbe" id="u70c72dbe"><span data-lake-id="u8df89dae" id="u8df89dae">alias=vaddr[13:12]</span></code></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u491f4e7c" id="u491f4e7c"><td data-lake-id="uf0c2a24b" id="uf0c2a24b"><p data-lake-id="u021140f6" id="u021140f6"><span data-lake-id="u8441f48a" id="u8441f48a">cmoResp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uef6f3efc" id="uef6f3efc"><p data-lake-id="uf86fb85c" id="uf86fb85c"><span data-lake-id="u33229372" id="u33229372">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9a11fa90" id="u9a11fa90"><p data-lake-id="u4bf86834" id="u4bf86834"><span data-lake-id="u5663d88a" id="u5663d88a">Decoupled</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u499980cf" id="u499980cf"><p data-lake-id="u9d6b32c2" id="u9d6b32c2"><code data-lake-id="u66fb4d42" id="u66fb4d42"><span data-lake-id="ud1a959ac" id="ud1a959ac">id</span></code><span data-lake-id="ueb799095" id="ueb799095">、</span><code data-lake-id="uc790da78" id="uc790da78"><span data-lake-id="uc5cefe1b" id="uc5cefe1b">done</span></code><span data-lake-id="u0d8f3759" id="u0d8f3759">、</span><code data-lake-id="uc925c593" id="uc925c593"><span data-lake-id="uc5ccea70" id="uc5ccea70">error</span></code><span data-lake-id="ude2c4ecd" id="ude2c4ecd">。只有收到 CompCMO 之后才返回</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="ud8966649" id="ud8966649"><code data-lake-id="u50a05034" id="u50a05034"><span data-lake-id="u1e2a553c" id="u1e2a553c">opcode</span></code><span data-lake-id="ua5b7d67e" id="ua5b7d67e"> 是 </span><code data-lake-id="ud28cd0b6" id="ud28cd0b6"><span data-lake-id="uf1bda766" id="uf1bda766">clean</span></code><span data-lake-id="u5742dc19" id="u5742dc19">、</span><code data-lake-id="uc56db49a" id="uc56db49a"><span data-lake-id="ubff30d34" id="ubff30d34">flush</span></code><span data-lake-id="u908deb50" id="u908deb50">、</span><code data-lake-id="uf77335e9" id="uf77335e9"><span data-lake-id="u118f2fe0" id="u118f2fe0">inval</span></code><span data-lake-id="uc4786191" id="uc4786191">、</span><code data-lake-id="ub2248ad7" id="ub2248ad7"><span data-lake-id="u616be6c9" id="u616be6c9">zero</span></code><span data-lake-id="ua2c8e713" id="ua2c8e713"> 四种。同一时间只有一条，</span><code data-lake-id="u5ddd324c" id="u5ddd324c"><span data-lake-id="ufcbc4457" id="ufcbc4457">txnId</span></code><span data-lake-id="u15e62f6f" id="u15e62f6f"> 固定为 16。CMO 和 miss 共用 TXREQ，有 miss 要发时 CMO 不能发。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="Bps4e" id="Bps4e"><span data-lake-id="u64afea90" id="u64afea90">wfi</span></h3><table data-lake-id="n7Fks" id="n7Fks" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="187.5"><col width="187.5"><col width="187.5"><col width="187.5"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u852f7f7c" id="u852f7f7c"><td data-lake-id="u67df6640" id="u67df6640"><p data-lake-id="u09013c0c" id="u09013c0c"><span data-lake-id="u6aa0ad3d" id="u6aa0ad3d">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5ba74d5c" id="u5ba74d5c"><p data-lake-id="u3cc903f1" id="u3cc903f1"><span data-lake-id="u07693465" id="u07693465">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u312c851d" id="u312c851d"><p data-lake-id="u18ae227f" id="u18ae227f"><span data-lake-id="ubcfaec10" id="ubcfaec10">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2c2afbb8" id="u2c2afbb8"><p data-lake-id="ubfee1a28" id="ubfee1a28"><span data-lake-id="ucc4d5258" id="ucc4d5258">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u47f6cf45" id="u47f6cf45"><td data-lake-id="u6ce24538" id="u6ce24538"><p data-lake-id="ub7e0cc98" id="ub7e0cc98"><span data-lake-id="u1066a5f0" id="u1066a5f0">wfi.req</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud8cffef9" id="ud8cffef9"><p data-lake-id="ufc5cb410" id="ufc5cb410"><span data-lake-id="u2062381f" id="u2062381f">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub30ec88c" id="ub30ec88c"><p data-lake-id="u0e8718d9" id="u0e8718d9"><span data-lake-id="u1e30c61b" id="u1e30c61b">Bool</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucd109ca8" id="ucd109ca8"><p data-lake-id="u60936628" id="u60936628"><span data-lake-id="u4b0ef444" id="u4b0ef444">ROB 请求检查</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u5bd7b5ce" id="u5bd7b5ce"><td data-lake-id="ua1281bc4" id="ua1281bc4"><p data-lake-id="u3aa35f90" id="u3aa35f90"><span data-lake-id="u5789797e" id="u5789797e">wfi.safe</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9461ac33" id="u9461ac33"><p data-lake-id="u1df0408f" id="u1df0408f"><span data-lake-id="u335f12a6" id="u335f12a6">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8f73461f" id="u8f73461f"><p data-lake-id="u534199fb" id="u534199fb"><span data-lake-id="u0bc5c27b" id="u0bc5c27b">Bool</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5099c934" id="u5099c934"><p data-lake-id="ue74452dc" id="ue74452dc"><span data-lake-id="u439674c4" id="u439674c4">可以休眠时为 1</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="ub35c4fe3" id="ub35c4fe3"><span data-lake-id="u51c97fab" id="u51c97fab">任一 MissEntry 还忙、CMO 还没收到 CompCMO，或者 CompAck 还没被 L2 收下，</span><code data-lake-id="ufd871360" id="ufd871360"><span data-lake-id="ua625b63d" id="ua625b63d">wfi.safe</span></code><span data-lake-id="ubbba83c3" id="ubbba83c3"> 都是 0。16 项空闲并且 CMO 空闲才为 1。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u456f7843" id="u456f7843"><span data-lake-id="u39cd84d0" id="u39cd84d0">WritebackQueue 中尚未完成的 Evict 或 WriteBackFull 不计入 </span><code data-lake-id="u66894533" id="u66894533"><span data-lake-id="u779173df" id="u779173df">wfi.safe</span></code><span data-lake-id="u8c7bd615" id="u8c7bd615">。</span></p>